WEBVTT

NOTE voice en-female English_Graceful_Lady

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.185
Open Lumen.

00:00:01.185 --> 00:00:03.333
The screen says Sign in.

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:08.704
Enter your email address and password, then choose Continue.

00:00:08.704 --> 00:00:12.821
Interface language only changes these buttons.

00:00:12.821 --> 00:00:17.387
It does not choose the voice in the finished video.

00:00:17.387 --> 00:00:23.115
Download video on this screen is the tutorial, not your project.

00:00:23.933 --> 00:00:27.398
After you sign in, open Video studio.

00:00:27.398 --> 00:00:29.927
New project shows the form.

00:00:29.927 --> 00:00:33.205
The heading is Learn the technique.

00:00:33.205 --> 00:00:34.703
Tell your story.

00:00:34.703 --> 00:00:38.075
A reference is required: one to five

00:00:38.075 --> 00:00:42.008
Douyin results, or a Reference video file.

00:00:42.008 --> 00:00:46.690
Analyze and build my plan stays off until your own

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:51.186
video and at least one reference are both there.

00:00:51.186 --> 00:00:54.089
The reference is measured only.

00:00:54.089 --> 00:00:59.989
Its pictures, speech, and music do not enter the finished file.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:03.747
Choose your video to upload.

00:01:03.747 --> 00:01:07.746
Use one vertical file you own, from 30

00:01:07.746 --> 00:01:12.167
seconds to 7 minutes, up to 250 megabytes.

00:01:12.167 --> 00:01:19.640
Fill in Project name, Script and intended message, Topic, and Audience.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:25.007
Tick I own or have permission to edit this footage.

00:01:25.007 --> 00:01:30.270
Caption language is English or Simplified Chinese.

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:34.796
That field is for subtitles, not the voice.

00:01:34.796 --> 00:01:40.269
Voice and style is a tone, such as calm and factual.

00:01:40.269 --> 00:01:42.479
It is not a voice id.

00:01:42.479 --> 00:01:46.899
Only your file becomes the project source.

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:50.132
Wait until analysis finishes.

00:01:50.132 --> 00:01:55.750
A voiceover cannot be created until the first picture has a render.

00:01:55.750 --> 00:02:00.949
If style match is on, Approve this cut renders the saved edit.

00:02:00.949 --> 00:02:03.297
If it is off, save the plan,

00:02:03.297 --> 00:02:06.986
then choose Create video with these changes.

00:02:06.986 --> 00:02:11.766
This first file still uses the sound of your own footage.

00:02:11.766 --> 00:02:15.875
Save and refresh summary does not create a video.

00:02:15.875 --> 00:02:20.654
Review edits and create a version only opens the summary.

00:02:20.654 --> 00:02:24.511
An unsaved draft does not change the download.

00:02:25.333 --> 00:02:29.152
Open Edit, then Voiceover and language.

00:02:29.152 --> 00:02:33.558
The panel says Create a translated voiceover.

00:02:33.558 --> 00:02:36.692
It opens on Russian and ru-male.

00:02:36.692 --> 00:02:41.391
For this English film, set Voiceover language to

00:02:41.391 --> 00:02:45.210
English, and AI voice to Female — warm.

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:47.266
That id is en-female.

00:02:47.266 --> 00:02:50.596
Preview voice makes a sample only.

00:02:50.596 --> 00:02:53.435
It is not the finished video.

00:02:53.435 --> 00:02:56.275
Choose Create dubbed version.

00:02:56.275 --> 00:03:01.464
The language and the voice must be this English pair.

00:03:01.464 --> 00:03:07.633
When the version is ready, Used in final video names en-female.

00:03:07.633 --> 00:03:12.333
Use original edit audio would remove that voice.

00:03:13.133 --> 00:03:14.857
Open the Audio tab.

00:03:14.857 --> 00:03:20.664
Under Background music, Track lists music you uploaded yourself.

00:03:20.664 --> 00:03:23.840
The empty choice is No added music.

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:28.104
Choosing a track writes it into the edit draft.

00:03:28.104 --> 00:03:30.554
It is not the download yet.

00:03:30.554 --> 00:03:34.183
Add music to final video saves the edit,

00:03:34.183 --> 00:03:38.448
then mixes that track under the selected voice.

00:03:38.448 --> 00:03:40.807
The voice stays en-female.

00:03:40.807 --> 00:03:46.069
If you add no track, the finished file has no added music.

00:03:46.069 --> 00:03:48.973
Reference music is never copied.

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:55.840
The tabs are Edit, Subtitles, Audio, Effects, Materials, and Review.

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:57.528
Approve each scene.

00:03:57.528 --> 00:04:01.703
Saving the edit does not start a render, and an

00:04:01.703 --> 00:04:06.678
unsaved draft does not change the file you can download.

00:04:06.678 --> 00:04:11.031
If the picture should change, choose Approve this

00:04:11.031 --> 00:04:15.028
cut or Create video with these changes again.

00:04:15.028 --> 00:04:20.269
The same voice, en-female, is carried into the new picture.

00:04:20.269 --> 00:04:24.888
Lumen does not generate a new voice for that render.

00:04:24.888 --> 00:04:27.908
If the new edit does not cover the

00:04:27.908 --> 00:04:32.083
voice ranges, the current finished video stays.

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:36.543
Wait until the project leaves rendering.

00:04:36.543 --> 00:04:43.375
In the header, choose Download video while the player shows Finished video.

00:04:43.375 --> 00:04:48.476
That file is the selected delivery: the new picture, the

00:04:48.476 --> 00:04:53.486
voice en-female, and your music track if you added one.

00:04:53.486 --> 00:04:57.676
The player and the download are the same file.

00:04:57.676 --> 00:05:01.319
A completed task is not proof by itself.

00:05:01.319 --> 00:05:04.780
If the render, the voice, or the music

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:09.243
fails, the previous finished file stays in place.

